hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1428","Ahmad bin Mani’ told us, Hushaym told us, Muhammad bin Ishaq told us, on the authority of Hafs bin Ubaid Allah bin Anas, on the authority of Anas, he said: The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, used to break his fast with dates on the Day of Fitr, then he would go out in the morning.”"
